B.ap7=new A.o8(B.j3,"5 min  \xb7  First-line benzodiazepine","Lorazepam 0.1 mg/kg IV (max 4 mg) OR Midazolam 0.2 mg/kg IM / 0.5 mg/kg buccal OR Diazepam 0.5 mg/kg PR. Repeat once at 10 min if still seizing.",null)
B.ap8=new A.o8(B.j3,"40 min  \xb7  Refractory \u2014 consider intubation","Midazolam infusion (after bolus 0.2 mg/kg) \u2014 start 1 \xb5g/kg/min, titrate. OR Pentobarbital 5 mg/kg load \u2192 1\u20133 mg/kg/h. OR Propofol 1\u20132 mg/kg load \u2192 1\u20134 mg/kg/h (watch for PRIS). Continuous EEG monitoring.",null)
